<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由国际公共广播电台发行。

00:58:09.510 --> 00:58:30.240
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[赞助商致谢]

00:58:30.240 --> 00:58:37.780
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who decided he did not want to come onto our program after he asked just one question.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督托里·马拉蒂亚，他决定在问了一个问题后，不想上我们的节目。

00:58:37.780 --> 00:58:40.150
<v Mrs. Mattoon>This is just radio? Not TV?
<v Mrs. Mattoon>这只是广播节目吗？不是电视？

00:58:40.150 --> 00:58:54.950
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着《美国生活》的更多故事回来。

